// v3.1.0  Signal-first rewrite: BUY/SELL arrows print from the
//         engines, independent of Trade Engine / open trade.
//         plotshape BUY/SELL, score grades (not a veto wall),
//         trap no longer swallows a passing STRAT trigger,
//         sweep reclaim + 2U/2D continuation, looser defaults.
// v3.0.1  Compile-clean Pine v6: missing inputs restored, UDFs
//         declared before use, ta.* called unconditionally,
//         tuple unpack (no [0] index), plot() at global scope,
//         BOS/CHoCH can initialize from flat, divergence uses
//         prior swing, trailing stop persists into SL.
// v3.0.0  SMC (BOS/CHoCH/FVG/OB), divergence, regime, sessions
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

//@version=6
indicator(
     title            = "STRAT PRO [Signal First]",
     shorttitle       = "STRAT PRO",
     overlay          = true,
     max_bars_back    = 5000,
     max_lines_count  = 500,
     max_labels_count = 500,
     max_boxes_count  = 500)

